  "I can't read old paper.": "content/audio/i-can-t-read-old-paper-9f1a15f3.m4a",
  "Wait... that's my family's name.": "content/audio/wait-that-s-my-family-s-name-2bfc0863.m4a",
  "Mrs. Ho, are you okay?": "content/audio/mrs-ho-are-you-okay-88c944f2.m4a",
  "That's a coincidence, probably.": "content/audio/that-s-a-coincidence-probably-49eee552.m4a",
  "I'm okay. This clipping... it's about my family's old house. We lived there when I was young. We moved here from far away, and that house was the first place that felt like home.": "content/audio/i-m-okay-this-clipping-it-s-about-my-fam-464dab77.m4a",
  "That's such a beautiful memory.": "content/audio/that-s-such-a-beautiful-memory-e1957ffe.m4a",
  "That's kind of sad.": "content/audio/that-s-kind-of-sad-60e0d978.m4a",
  "It was. But we didn't stay there forever.": "content/audio/it-was-but-we-didn-t-stay-there-forever-7e43db04.m4a",
  "What happened after that?": "content/audio/what-happened-after-that-26d5b61d.m4a",
  "I don't need to know.": "content/audio/i-don-t-need-to-know-5c038e78.m4a",
